# English Only

## Invariant

All new or edited code, comments, docstrings, Cursor rules, skills, and AI-drafted commit text must be in English.

## STOP list

- Non-English identifiers or docstrings on new code → use English names
- Mixed-language comments → English only

## Exceptions

- User-facing product copy may be localized later. Source and docs stay English.
- Quoted external names (model tags such as `qwen2.5:7b`) stay as published.
